  - key: cuaso_h
    en: Tap on the largest window of the house behind
    vn: "B\u1EA5m v\xE0o c\u1EEDa s\u1ED5 to nh\u1EA5t c\u1EE7a c\u0103n nh\xE0 ph\xEDa
