  - key: cuanha_s
    en: Why are so many people gathered here?
    vn: "T\u1EA1i sao nhi\u1EC1u ng\u01B0\u1EDDi t\u1EADp trung \u1EDF \u0111\xE2y
      v\u1EADy"
  - key: cuanha_h
    en: Tap on the door of the house behind
    vn: "B\u1EA5m v\xE0o c\u1EEDa c\u1EE7a c\u0103n nh\xE0 ph\xEDa sau"
  - key: ao_s
    en: His body looks terrible
    vn: "Th\xE2n h\xECnh c\u1EE7a h\u1EAFn tr\xF4ng gh\xEA qu\xE1"
  - key: ao_h
    en: Pull the cock on the man
    vn: "K\xE9o v\xF2i n\u01B0\u1EDBc v\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng"
  - key: hat_s
    en: He sings like a pig
    vn: "H\u1EAFn h\xE1t nh\u01B0 chaien v\u1EADy"
  - key: hat_h
    en: Pull the microphone at the man
    vn: "K\xE9o c\xE1i micro v\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng"
  - key: sach_s
    en: He can't even read books!
    vn: "H\u1EAFn th\u1EADm ch\xED kh\xF4ng th\u1EC3 \u0111\u1ECDc s\xE1ch!"
  - key: sach_h
    en: Dragging the stack of books at the man
    vn: "K\xE9o ch\u1ED3ng s\xE1ch v\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng"
  - key: toc_s
    en: I don't like bald people
    vn: "T\xF4i kh\xF4ng th\xEDch ng\u01B0\u1EDDi h\xF3i"
  - key: toc_h
    en: Pulling the dryer on the man
    vn: "K\xE9o m\xE1y s\u1EA5y v\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng"
  - key: mat_s
    en: Looks like a gorilla
    vn: "Tr\xF4ng nh\u01B0 kh\u1EC9 \u0111\u1ED9t v\u1EADy"
  - key: mat_h
    en: Pull the blue towel on the man
    vn: "K\xE9o c\xE1i kh\u0103n m\xE0u xanh d\u01B0\u01A1ng v\xE0o ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng"
  - key: vi_s
    en: I thought he had some money
    vn: "T\xF4i c\xF2n t\u01B0\u1EDFng h\u1EAFn c\xF3 ch\xFAt ti\u1EC1n"
  - key: vi_h
    en: Tap on the wallet in the man's pocket
    vn: "B\u1EA5m v\xE0o v\xED trong t\xFAi qu\u1EA7n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi \u0111\xE0n
      \xF4ng"
  - key: chiakhoa_s
    en: Is this a lighter?!
    vn: "C\xE1i n\xE0y l\xE0 b\u1EADt l\u1EEDa m\xE0 ?!"
  - key: chiakhoa_h
    en: Tap on the key hanging on the man's pants
    vn: "B\u1EA5m v\xE0o chi\u1EBFc ch\xECa kh\xF3a treo tr\xEAn qu\u1EA7n ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
      \u0111\xE0n \xF4ng"
  - key: xe_s
    en: The car is not his!
    vn: "Xe \u0111\xE2u ph\u1EA3i c\u1EE7a anh ta!"
  - key: xe_h
    en: Tap on the red car behind
    vn: "B\u1EA5m v\xE0o xe m\xE0u \u0111\u1ECF ph\xEDa sau"
